  "notes": "USAGE:\nOne of the most common household vocabulary words. Used with する to form the verb \"to do laundry\" ({洗濯|せんたく}する). The kanji {濯|たく} is rarely seen outside this word.\n\nBe careful not to confuse with the homophone {選択|せんたく} (selection, choice), which uses different kanji.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {洗濯|せんたく}する: to do laundry\n- {洗濯|せんたく}{物|もの}: laundry (items to be washed or drying)\n- {洗濯機|せんたくき}: washing machine\n- {洗濯|せんたく}{物|もの}を{干|ほ}す: to hang laundry to dry\n- {洗濯|せんたく}{物|もの}を{取|と}り{込|こ}む: to bring in the laundry",
